message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "mpss-centos7-uefi: Reproducible deployment of Intel Xeon Phi (Knights Corner) coprocessors on UEFI CentOS 7"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible toolkit and kernel configuration patch that deploys Intel Xeon
  Phi Knights Corner (KNC) coprocessors with MPSS 3.8.6 on UEFI-based CentOS 7.9
  / RHEL 7 hosts, by resolving an undocumented kernel module-signature
  enforcement deadlock caused by firmware that mis-reports UEFI Secure Boot.
type: software
